docs/ergoworks-consulting/open-questions.md:47:| Landing-page delivery | Developer, host, route and target date |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/open-questions.md:56:| Separation architecture | Client decision plus current GA4 stream, GTM container and Meta Dataset inventory | Consulting/Physiotherapy de-mixing |
