docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:5:ErgoWorks is not starting from zero. Google Ads account **9258098368** already contains a mature Consulting Search campaign (**700072710**) spending approximately **A$40,000 trailing 12 months**, with an observed range of **A$3.0k–A$4.7k per month** and approximately **20 real leads per month**. The campaign uses **Maximize Conversions with no target CPA**.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:7:Search captures existing demand; Meta must create demand that does not yet exist. In the last 90 days, GA4 property **316175981** recorded **zero paid-social activity** and only three Organic Social sessions. Paid traffic also lacks a dedicated conversion landing page and currently reaches generic WordPress service pages.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:11:1. Improve message match within the existing Search program.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:12:2. Introduce the Snapshot and implementation pathway through Meta demand generation.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:15:No campaign, creative, landing page, pixel, form, or live account should be changed until client approval, measurement repair, and the pre-launch privacy gate are complete.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:35:This positioning does **not** promise injury prevention, WHS compliance, medical outcomes, reduced claims, or a quantified financial result.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:39:> For WHS/HSE, HR/People & Culture and Facilities teams that need a practical way to manage workplace-ergonomics priorities, ErgoWorks provides a defined path from risk visibility to prioritised action and implementation evidence—across workstations, hybrid workplaces and manual tasks.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:45:| WHS/HSE | Visibility, prioritisation and evidence of action | Consistent assessment approach, practical controls, documented implementation | Anonymised action plan, programme coverage, professional credentials |
