docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:232:Manual handling training remains the current spend anchor and largest verified **training-intent demand head** at **2,700 Australian searches per month** (`research/keyword-research-ahrefs-2026-07-13.md` §1). Research also identifies an approximately **3,400-searches-per-month mixed-intent certificate/course pool**, with buyer type **UNCLASSIFIED**, and an approximately **780-searches-per-month care-sector opportunity**. This aligns with the existing Manual Handling Training ad group, which accounted for **A$2,069, or 49% of Consulting Search spend, in the last 30 days**; the two expansion pockets remain gated and are not verified service fit.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:234:The term should lead Search message development and serve as an accessible entry point in Meta creative, while the landing page connects training to the wider path:
