docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/B-keyword-adgroup-sheets.md:480:Future scaling note (not launch): if the Meta budget later increases under the 20%-increment rule (Scenarios 2–3 trajectory), a geo-weighted or ACT-specific ad set may be considered — but only once volume supports a second ad set independently meeting the A$600 per 30 days / A$20 per day floor. The Canberra pocket is real but small (3 conversions); do not fragment the single consolidated ad set now.
