docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:1:# Appendix A — Landing Page Wireframe + Full Copy
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:5:Build one dedicated, long-form landing-page system on `ergoworksconsulting.com.au`, with three message-matched variants:
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:11:These pages replace the generic WordPress destinations currently receiving paid traffic. The business case for the dedicated LP rests on **message match, offer and form — not speed**: the live site is already fast (Lighthouse 97 mobile on the manual-handling page, LCP 2.0s, CLS 0, per `research/live-evidence-2026-07-12.md` §Lighthouse), so the new page must merely not regress below those thresholds. The system supports the existing mature Google Search program—approximately **A$40,000 trailing 12 months**, with an observed range of **A$3.0k–A$4.7k per month** and approximately **20 real leads per month**—and the proposed Meta demand-generation activity.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:26:| 4 | Benefit blocks | Explain controllable business outputs | Three concise blocks covering visibility, prioritisation and implementation—not guaranteed health, injury, compliance or claims outcomes. |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:39:- Match the ad’s CTA to the landing-page CTA. Target the skill’s **100% message-match standard**: headline, offer and CTA aligned.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:40:- Keep the Snapshot visibly B2B: use “organisation”, “workplace”, “WHS”, “HR”, “Facilities” and “team-size band”.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:43:- Avoid health or injury narratives, personal-attribute messaging and open text boxes that invite medical information.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:44:- Do not claim that the service guarantees injury prevention, ensures WHS compliance, eliminates absenteeism or produces a stated reduction in claims.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:48:- **All LP variants ship `noindex,follow` with a canonical to the closest existing service page.** Organic is negligible for this domain (15 keywords, ~60 visits/month), so there is no SEO upside — and indexing the LP risks cannibalising the one organic asset that matters: a blog post ranking **#1 for "manual handling certificate"** (`research/live-evidence-2026-07-12.md` §Ahrefs). The LP must not chase SEO; index only if the client later retires that blog post.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:49:- **Geography claim is a LAUNCH BLOCKER, not a passive sign-off item.** The live site commits to Sydney and Melbourne only, while this appendix's header/proof strip says "Australia-wide … client sign-off required" and search terms span Canberra, Sydney, Brisbane and national terms. The only converting geo-specific term is `ergonomic office fyshwick` (the Sydney/Melbourne/Brisbane/near-me geo terms appear in the pull but did not convert). The LP cannot claim broader coverage than the live site until verified; if coverage IS Sydney/Melbourne-only, the Canberra spend needs a geo decision, not just copy (see open-questions.md, service-geography question).
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:63:ErgoWorks helps WHS, HR and operational teams connect practical training with the manual tasks, work patterns and control priorities present in their workplace. **Delivery format and service scope are client-sign-off required; do not publish onsite or online capability until confirmed.**
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:65:*Research supports testing online intent, but it does not verify delivery capability. Hold any online claim behind client sign-off and keep any approved framing organisational (“for your team”)—never an individual e-learning promise.*
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:84:“Manual handling certificate” is the largest single search term by spend in the **2026-07-12 30-day top-60 pull** (**A$364.86 / 55 clicks / 1.67 conversions**, per `research/live-evidence-2026-07-12.md`), yet the live page never says “certificate” once. Some certificate queries convert (“manual handling certificate online australia” produced 1.33 conversions from A$15.92), but buyer type is unclassified — treat this as mixed individual/corporate intent until CRM classification confirms it. This is therefore a disqualifier-plus-reframe block on this variant — not a separate page and not silence.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:129:For aged-care, healthcare or disability-support organisations planning workplace training for teams and supervisors. **Do not publish until sector scope is confirmed, the live aged-care/disability/healthcare negatives are reconciled, and onsite/remote geography is approved.** Never imply that the viewer or a participant has a disability, injury or health condition.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:229:### Will the training ensure WHS compliance or prevent injuries?
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:273:ErgoWorks helps WHS, HR and Facilities teams define assessment scope, document workplace observations and prioritise practical actions across individual workstations, teams or sites.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:306:Translate observations into clear next steps for employees, managers, WHS teams and Facilities stakeholders.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:352:- A WHS team defining assessment coverage
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:361:*The Snapshot is preliminary guidance only. It is not a compliance assessment, compliance certification, medical assessment or diagnosis. It does not replace a formal workplace assessment, professional medical advice or applicable WHS duties.*
