docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:454:ErgoWorks helps WHS, HR and workplace teams define assessment coverage, employee guidance, action priorities and reporting across distributed workforces.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:464:Planning a hybrid-work, return-to-office or home-office programme? Share the organisational need and an ErgoWorks consultant can help identify an appropriate next step.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:487:Give WHS, HR and Facilities stakeholders a structured view of the agreed programme’s observations and follow-up actions.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:523:The **free 15-minute Workplace Ergonomics Risk Snapshot** is a short B2B discussion about one defined home-office, hybrid-work or return-to-office question.
