docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:947:1. Dedicated message-matched page versus current generic destination. The control is not a slow page: it is a fast (Lighthouse 97), content-heavy but conversion-weak page — single "Make an Enquiry" CTA, full navigation with 30+ links, zero certificate handling and a keyword-stuffed body. Name the specific hypotheses the live page hands us so the test is interpretable rather than "new vs old": **stripped nav vs 30+ nav links; Snapshot offer vs bare enquiry form; certificate block vs none.**
