docs/ergoworks-consulting/ergoworks-campaign-plan.md:5:ErgoWorks Consulting already has a mature Google Search program. This plan is an optimisation and expansion programme—not a greenfield launch.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/ergoworks-campaign-plan.md:9:1. **Protect and improve existing Search demand capture** by cleaning conversion goals, auditing query quality, strengthening Brand coverage and routing paid traffic to relevant landing-page variants.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/ergoworks-campaign-plan.md:10:2. **Open Meta as the missing demand-generation lever** using workplace- and role-level creative, beginning with one consolidated prospecting ad set.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/ergoworks-campaign-plan.md:11:3. **Launch a dedicated conversion landing page** centred on the free 15-minute Workplace Ergonomics Risk Snapshot—**preliminary guidance only—not a compliance assessment, compliance certification, medical assessment or diagnosis**.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/ergoworks-campaign-plan.md:12:4. **Connect media to qualified pipeline outcomes** through CRM stages, offline conversion imports, server-side tagging and Meta CAPI.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/ergoworks-campaign-plan.md:15:The preferred minimum launch envelope is **A$4,846 per 30-day planning period**: preserve the verified A$4,246 last-30-day Search baseline and add A$600 for one Meta prospecting ad set. This remains subject to commercial approval, Snapshot delivery capacity, landing-page readiness and the Australian privacy gate.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/ergoworks-campaign-plan.md:27:| Optimise existing Search | Capture established commercial demand more accurately and efficiently |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/ergoworks-campaign-plan.md:28:| Add Meta demand generation | Reach WHS/HSE, HR/People & Culture, Facilities and Operations buyers before they search |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/ergoworks-campaign-plan.md:30:| Use a dedicated landing page | Replace generic WordPress destinations with message-matched conversion journeys |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/ergoworks-campaign-plan.md:34:Search remains the proven demand-capture engine. Meta adds the top-of-funnel reach that the current programme lacks. The landing page and Snapshot connect those channels to a coherent commercial journey, while the measurement rebuild ensures future allocation is based on qualified pipeline rather than raw platform conversions.
