docs/ergoworks-consulting/ergoworks-campaign-plan.md:123:| **3. Meta plus funded PMax** | A$4,246 | A$600 | A$1,500 | A$0 | **A$6,346** | Consider only after all PMax gates pass |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/ergoworks-campaign-plan.md:129:| Meta | **A$20/day or A$600 per ad set per 30 days** | Keep the initial budget in one consolidated prospecting ad set |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/ergoworks-campaign-plan.md:133:The provisional Meta Snapshot-request CPA planning range of **A$53.08–A$84.92** is assumption-based, not observed performance or a commercial target. It assumes the lower-friction Snapshot request costs 25%–40% of the current approximately A$212 raw Search lead cost. It must be replaced with observed data.
