docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/C-tracking-spec.md:273:The assigned attribution methodology prefers an advanced-mode implementation. That conflicts with this campaign’s stricter requirement: **Consent Mode v2, default denied, with no client- or server-side analytics/advertising transmission before consent.** The stricter ErgoWorks rule governs. Cookieless pings may be considered only after explicit Australian legal/privacy approval. The methodology’s 700+ ad-clicks/day per country/domain modelling threshold is also not met by the verified last-30d Search volume of 407 clicks, so behavioural-modelling recovery must not be assumed.
