docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/C-tracking-spec.md:363:- Use a provisional **30-day Google click window** for B2B lead generation, then review actual conversion lag quarterly. Extend toward 60–90 days only if CRM evidence shows the sales cycle requires it.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/C-tracking-spec.md:364:- Treat Meta’s platform attribution using its supported settings; begin with the standard 7-day click/1-day view reporting context where required, but treat view-through conversions as directional rather than proof of incrementality.
