docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:339:**Online-delivery note:** use “Manual Handling Online” only for Appendix B `GOOGLE_CONV_Online-Teams_AU_2026Q3`, with organisational framing in a description such as “Flexible online manual-handling training formats for workplace teams.” The verified three-keyword set represents approximately 290 searches/month and the live account also contains a converting online-intent tail. Keep this angle in Search—never port it to Meta, and do not use individual credential language.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:351:This themed RSA set serves Appendix B `GOOGLE_CONV_Care-Sector_AU_2026Q3`. **Do not build or publish it until sector scope is confirmed, the live aged-care/disability/healthcare negatives are reconciled, and onsite/remote geography is approved; replace `_AU_` with the approved geo if national service is unverified.** It must qualify an organisational buyer and use care-sector workplace language; it must not imply that the viewer or any individual has a disability, injury or health condition.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:372:This RSA set serves Appendix B `GOOGLE_CONV_Certificate-MixedIntent_AU_2026Q3` and the approximately 3,400-searches-per-month certificate/course pool. Buyer type is **UNCLASSIFIED**. Use Exact and Phrase only, qualify the organisational need in ad copy, and route to the gated certificate LP block. **Do not build or publish until ErgoWorks confirms whether it issues an accredited certificate, statement of attainment, or participant attendance/training-completion records and signs off the corresponding claims.** Exclude this theme from Meta.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:405:- Support WHS, HR and Facilities teams with consistent assessments and practical guidance.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:474:## Meta demand-generation creative brief
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:480:Meta should not be optimised around cheap raw leads. The intended conversion is a qualified B2B enquiry or Snapshot request, supported by a clean measurement baseline and offline qualification feedback.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:484:All Meta messaging must:
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:490:- Never guarantee injury prevention, compliance, claim reduction or financial savings.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:491:- Avoid employee-level health or injury fields in lead forms.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:493:- Pass AU privacy review before pixel, CAPI, CRM or campaign activation.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:494:- **The only permitted occurrence of "certificate" or "certification" in Meta creative is inside the mandatory Snapshot caveat: “Preliminary guidance only—not a compliance assessment, compliance certification, medical assessment or diagnosis.”** That sanctioned negative caveat is required wherever the Snapshot appears and is not a violation of this rule. Never use certificate/certification as a hook, offer, audience signal or benefit, including when referencing client-sign-off-gated participant attendance or training-completion records. This avoids attracting individual certificate-seeker intent that contaminates a corporate-buyer prospecting audience ("manual handling certificate" drew A$364.86 / 55 clicks in 30 days). This is a positioning and contamination rule, not a claimed Meta review trigger.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:506:Minor colour or headline variations do not constitute distinct concepts. Meta’s retrieval system may suppress near-identical ads; concepts must differ in angle, visual story and value proposition.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:510:**Audience signal:** WHS, operations, training and workplace decision-makers. Launch targeting: **approved service geography only** (see Appendix B audience strategy). Australia-wide, Canberra/ACT, Sydney, Melbourne and Brisbane expansion is wholly behind geography sign-off. Meta has no job-title targeting, so individual credential-seekers must be filtered via negative signals: exclude engagement with personal-credential, generic-course, individual-online-training and TAFE/RTO-style creative CTAs from prospecting, and add an Advantage+ audience exclusion list built from website visitors who bounce off non-B2B pages.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:631:### Gated post-baseline service-led CTA tests
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:633:Only after the Snapshot baseline has sufficient clean volume and qualified-lead evidence may service-led primary CTAs be tested against it. Preserve each concept's organisational framing and use the applicable service CTA: Concept 1, “Request a manual-task programme scope”; Concept 2, “Explore the ErgoWorks implementation pathway”; Concept 3, “Request a hybrid-work programme scope”; Concept 4, “Discuss a workplace or fitout review”; Concept 6, “Explore ongoing programme management.” These are post-baseline test variants, not launch creative, and must not be presented as simultaneous competing CTAs within a Snapshot execution.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:635:### Meta copy limits and production specifications
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:654:- Review Meta creative every **14–21 days**.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:665:## Dedicated landing-page message brief
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:677:Within that first variant, prepare the explicitly gated, scope-pending modules in Appendix A: care-sector for Appendix B `GOOGLE_CONV_Care-Sector_AU_2026Q3`; flexible online-team delivery for `GOOGLE_CONV_Online-Teams_AU_2026Q3`; and refresher/recurring programme for `GOOGLE_CONV_Refresher-Teams_AU_2026Q3`. **None may publish until the client confirms the service, delivery format and approved geography.** The care module also requires reconciliation of the live aged-care/disability/healthcare negatives. The online module is Search-only and must never be used as a Meta angle. Refresher cadence, participant outputs and recurring-service framing remain client-sign-off-dependent.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:709:> Give WHS, HR and Facilities teams a clear view of what needs attention and what should happen next.
