docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/D-creative-briefs.md:866:| Consent and privacy | CMP, **Consent Mode v2, default denied, with no client- or server-side analytics/advertising transmission before consent**, privacy notices and cross-business data boundaries not assessed | Australian privacy review and documented implementation scope |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:11:These pages replace the generic WordPress destinations currently receiving paid traffic. The business case for the dedicated LP rests on **message match, offer and form — not speed**: the live site is already fast (Lighthouse 97 mobile on the manual-handling page, LCP 2.0s, CLS 0, per `research/live-evidence-2026-07-12.md` §Lighthouse), so the new page must merely not regress below those thresholds. The system supports the existing mature Google Search program—approximately **A$40,000 trailing 12 months**, with an observed range of **A$3.0k–A$4.7k per month** and approximately **20 real leads per month**—and the proposed Meta demand-generation activity.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:26:| 4 | Benefit blocks | Explain controllable business outputs | Three concise blocks covering visibility, prioritisation and implementation—not guaranteed health, injury, compliance or claims outcomes. |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:40:- Keep the Snapshot visibly B2B: use “organisation”, “workplace”, “WHS”, “HR”, “Facilities” and “team-size band”.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:43:- Avoid health or injury narratives, personal-attribute messaging and open text boxes that invite medical information.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:44:- Do not claim that the service guarantees injury prevention, ensures WHS compliance, eliminates absenteeism or produces a stated reduction in claims.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:63:ErgoWorks helps WHS, HR and operational teams connect practical training with the manual tasks, work patterns and control priorities present in their workplace. **Delivery format and service scope are client-sign-off required; do not publish onsite or online capability until confirmed.**
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/A-landing-page-copy.md:129:For aged-care, healthcare or disability-support organisations planning workplace training for teams and supervisors. **Do not publish until sector scope is confirmed, the live aged-care/disability/healthcare negatives are reconciled, and onsite/remote geography is approved.** Never imply that the viewer or a participant has a disability, injury or health condition.
