docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/B-keyword-adgroup-sheets.md:121:Decision: preferred minimum launch scenario. It protects the existing Search run-rate while funding one Meta ad set above both sufficiency checks. It does not achieve the intended 80/20 active-channel mix; that overlay should not override the current event-level planning assumptions or platform floor.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/B-keyword-adgroup-sheets.md:123:Meta receives **A$20/day** over 30 days. Keep this in one consolidated prospecting ad set initially. Build retargeting audiences but do not fragment the budget.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/B-keyword-adgroup-sheets.md:125:### Scenario 3 — Minimum-viable Meta plus PMax at its floor
