docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/B-keyword-adgroup-sheets.md:259:| `GOOGLE_CONV_Certificate-MixedIntent_AU_2026Q3` — Certificate / Course — Mixed Intent | `[manual handling certificate]`, `[manual handling course]`, plus approved gated variants below | Phrase counterparts of approved Exact terms | **Search-only; buyer type UNCLASSIFIED.** Organisational qualification and the gated certificate LP block are required. Do not build or publish until ErgoWorks signs off what it issues, including accreditation and participant attendance/training-completion records. Excluded from Meta |
