docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/B-keyword-adgroup-sheets.md:387:| **A — dedicated Certificate / Course mixed-intent split (RECOMMENDED, gated trial)** | Build as `GOOGLE_CONV_Certificate-MixedIntent_AU_2026Q3`, Search-only, using Exact + Phrase and organisational qualification; route to the Manual Handling variant's certificate block. Do not build or publish until the client confirms whether ErgoWorks issues an accredited certificate, statement of attainment, or participant attendance/training-completion records | The verified approximately 3,400+ search/month pool makes the trial material rather than fringe, but buyer type remains **UNCLASSIFIED**. **Gated on the LP certificate block, accreditation and participant-record evidence, and client sign-off** (Appendix A); excluded from Meta |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/B-keyword-adgroup-sheets.md:390:“Accredited manual handling training” at **60 searches/month** makes accreditation a keyword-visible product question. ErgoWorks must confirm whether it provides accredited training, a statement of attainment, or participant attendance/training-completion records before the term, claim or landing-page block can publish; absent that evidence, do not bid on accreditation intent and do not imply equivalence. In either option, **Meta never targets certificate intent** (see Appendix D).
