src/app/ergoworks/plan/audit/page.tsx:179:              The account has a mature Search foundation, but its conversion objective is mixed and its expansion pockets are not yet independently funded or measured. Clean the signal first; then make every bid, budget and rebuild decision conditional on qualified pipeline.
