src/app/ergoworks/plan/audit/page.tsx:204:            The evidence was verified as at 12 July 2026 and includes last-30-day search terms, the full keyword/status/match-type/headline-Quality-Score inventory and 493 negatives. A full audit still requires longer history, RSAs/assets, complete campaign settings, Quality Score components and geo/device performance reports. No live-account changes are authorised by this plan.
