docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md-37-
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md:38:No bidding or budget decision should precede conversion cleanup. Campaign 700072710 currently uses Maximize Conversions, so every primary action can influence bidding. Counting newsletter registrations and soft engagement actions as success risks directing spend toward users most likely to take easy actions rather than become qualified Consulting opportunities.
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md-39-
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md-40-### Proposed Consulting conversion hierarchy
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md-41-
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md-42-| Conversion stage | Definition | Google Ads treatment |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md-43-|---|---|---|
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md:44:| Qualified call | Unique Consulting-attributed call that meets the client-approved duration and operating-hours conditions and is dispositioned as a legitimate new-business B2B workplace-ergonomics enquiry; exact rule awaiting client approval | **Primary only through the qualified offline import once reliable** |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md:45:| Qualified lead | Enquiry or call accepted in the CRM after confirming a business need, organisational fit, valid contact and plausible service scope | Secondary while validated; future Primary after sufficient clean offline volume |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md:46:| Proposal issued | Qualified opportunity that reaches a documented proposal stage | Secondary initially; eligible for value-based optimisation later |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md-47-| Closed-won | Signed Consulting engagement with verified revenue or margin | Secondary initially; future value signal once volume and data quality are sufficient |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md-48-| Newsletter Sign Up | Marketing subscription only | **Secondary** |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md-49-| Email Click | Click on an email link without confirmed enquiry | **Secondary** |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md-50-| Click-to-call | Click or tap without a connected, qualified conversation | **Secondary** |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md-51-| Call Forwarding | Technical call-routing interaction without qualification | **Secondary** |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md-52-| Local actions | Directions, local engagement or other soft action | **Secondary** |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md:53:| Snapshot request (`snapshot_request`) | Valid B2B request for the free 15-minute Workplace Ergonomics Risk Snapshot | Primary initially |
docs/ergoworks-consulting/appendices/E-existing-account-audit.md:54:| Direct enquiry (`direct_enquiry`) | Valid B2B direct-enquiry form submission | Primary initially |
